        <h3>Where the three chairs actually stop</h3>
        <p>Published overall-height and seat-height ranges let you back out the backrest top above the seat pan. Subtract minimum seat height from minimum overall height, and the result is how far the backrest rises above where you sit.</p>

        <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border my-6">
          <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-border bg-secondary/30">
