            View Engineered Now HW Headrest on Amazon →
          </a>
        </div>

        <h3>Engineered Now H4 — for Aeron Classic (1994–2016)</h3>
        <p><strong>Fits:</strong> Aeron Classic &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Finish:</strong> Carbon &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Price:</strong> ~$140–170</p>
        <p>The H4 is the Classic-generation counterpart. If you bought a used or refurbished Aeron, this is more likely the correct part than the HW — most of the secondhand Aeron supply predates 2016. Identify the generation before ordering: the Remastered has a smoother, more uniform mesh weave and a redesigned posture-fit lumbar assembly, while the Classic uses the older separated pad hardware.</p>
        <p>Community reports on refurbished Aeron builds note occasional variation in back-frame tolerances, which can affect clamp seating. Check the seller's <a href="/office-chair-return-policy/">return window</a> before committing — refurbished units often carry shorter terms than a direct Herman Miller order.</p>

