            View Engineered Now H4 Headrest on Amazon →
          </a>
        </div>

        <h3>Atlas Headrest for Aeron (Graphite)</h3>
        <p><strong>Fits:</strong> Herman Miller Aeron &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Finish:</strong> Graphite &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Price:</strong> ~$190</p>
        <p>Atlas is the other established name in this category, priced at the top of the range. The design intent is the same — a frame-mounted arm carrying an adjustable pad — with a finish chosen to match graphite Aeron frames. Confirm the listing's stated generation compatibility, since Atlas has shipped variants across the Classic and Remastered lines.</p>

        <div class="not-prose mt-4 mb-6">
